  "short_description": "《霧鎖王國》是一款單人及合作生存動作 RPG，你的自由與創意永遠是第一優先。征服吞噬餘火之谷的腐化迷霧「霧幕」：探索一個手工打造、充滿秘密的世界，隨心所欲塑造你的英雄，並在完全可改造的大地上，隨處建造任何東西。",
  "short_description_en": "Enshrouded is a solo and co-op survival action RPG where your freedom and creativity come first. Conquer the Shroud, a corrupting fog devouring the kingdom of Embervale: explore a handcrafted world full of secrets, forge your hero your way, and build anything, anywhere in a fully terraformable land.",
